# projects/meta-app-review-publish-scopes/SUBMISSION.md. (User decision 2026-05-24.)
/submission.md
/SUBMISSION.md

# Dependencies
# No trailing slash: also matches the §5a wire_env node_modules SYMLINKS
# (`node_modules/` matches dirs only ⇒ a symlink-to-dir leaked as untracked and
# blocked `git worktree remove` during a self-branch cleanup — 2026-05-25 dogfood).
node_modules
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.venv/

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.services
# NOTE: .env.example / .env.services.example are NOT ignored — templates with placeholder values, not secrets

# Deploy-local RENDERED files — filled-in-place on the VPS from a tracked *.template.
# Gitignored so a `git pull` can NEVER touch the live tunnel config by construction
# (the "nothing-to-clobber" net, deploy-hardening Phase 2 / P4). The TEMPLATE
# (config.yml.template, placeholders only — no secrets) stays tracked.
# See KB § GUIDES/production-deploy.md § 2a and that project's PROJECT.md Phase 2.
**/tunnel/config.yml
# cloudflared named-tunnel credentials JSON (<TUNNEL_ID>.json) — a SECRET generated
# on the VPS by `cloudflared tunnel create`; deploy-local, never committed. Enforces
# the deploy_state.py D3 invariant (tunnel/*.json must be gitignored).
**/tunnel/*.json

