# Migration reference — external read-only repo snapshot (the `one-permutas` legacy app).
# Brought in for the production-deploy-migration project as reference only; NOT noc code
# (117M of upstream-committed venv/staticfiles/frontend_build, incl. a real .env.production
# secret + .DS_Store). The `*` + leading `**/` match BOTH the live location and the archived
# one (archiving moves the project to `archive/projects/<date>/NN-…` with a numeric prefix —
# `01-production-deploy-migration`). NOT a blanket `archive/` ignore: archive/ intentionally
# tracks every project's PROJECT.md/findings.md history. See that project's PROJECT.md.
**/*production-deploy-migration/reference/
